  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7152901",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "716665001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "716665001": {
            "id": "716665001",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arataki Itto",
            "text": "This makes no sense... How did you do that!? My... my reputation is destroyed!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665002"
            ]
          },
          "716665002": {
            "id": "716665002",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "No-Frills Instant Kill",
            "text": "It was an honor doing battle with you, good Sir.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665003"
            ]
          },
          "716665003": {
            "id": "716665003",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arataki Itto",
            "text": "What the... So polite!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665004"
            ]
          },
          "716665004": {
            "id": "716665004",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Haha! So, been busy losing while we were away, Bull-Chu{RUBY#[S]\"Bona-Fide Beetle Battle King\"}cker?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665005"
            ]
          },
          "716665005": {
            "id": "716665005",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "No-Frills Instant Kill",
            "text": "I don't see it that way. Unless the Bona-Fide Beetle Battle King is ready to give up now, he hasn't lost to me yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665006"
            ]
          },
          "716665006": {
            "id": "716665006",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "No-Frills Instant Kill",
            "text": "In battle, and in life, it's normal to hit setbacks every once in a while. But a setback only turns into a failure if you make the decision to stop trying.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665007"
            ]
          },
          "716665007": {
            "id": "716665007",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arataki Itto",
            "text": "Word! Heck yeah! I ain't about to admit defeat yet!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665008"
            ]
          },
          "716665008": {
            "id": "716665008",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "No-Frills Instant Kill",
            "text": "Still, there's nothing to be gained from constantly making excuses. Don't put all your energy into talking garbage — spend it on fighting a little harder instead.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665009"
            ]
          },
          "716665009": {
            "id": "716665009",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arataki Itto",
            "text": "Oof, burn...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665010"
            ]
          },
          "716665010": {
            "id": "716665010",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Grandmaster Hanakado",
            "text": "Oni King, this brand of enemy doesn't seem to be your area of expertise. I advise you send in another of your generals and observe the duel in detail.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665011"
            ]
          },
          "716665011": {
            "id": "716665011",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Grandmaster Hanakado",
            "text": "Watching others do battle is also a crucial part of a warrior's training. Some skills, one learns by doing. Others, one learns through observation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665012"
            ]
          },
          "716665012": {
            "id": "716665012",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arataki Itto",
            "text": "Good point, Grandmaster! And good timing, compadre! Oni King's Right Hand, I'm handing the fight over to you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665013"
            ]
          },
          "716665013": {
            "id": "716665013",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Hehe, finally it's your turn! Make it count, {NICKNAME}!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665016"
            ]
          },
          "716665016": {
            "id": "716665016",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "No-Frills Instant Kill",
            "text": "#So I'm going head-to-head with the legendary {NICKNAME}? Guess I'd better look sharp..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7152903",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "716665101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "716665101": {
            "id": "716665101",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "No-Frills Instant Kill",
            "text": "Nicely done. You beat me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665102"
            ]
          },
          "716665102": {
            "id": "716665102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "No-Frills Instant Kill",
            "text": "#I'd go as far as to say that it's an honor to lose against {NICKNAME}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665103"
            ]
          },
          "716665103": {
            "id": "716665103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arataki Itto",
            "text": "Ahhh, so that's how you do it! I never would've thought of that!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665104"
            ]
          },
          "716665104": {
            "id": "716665104",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yup! When you're up against a cunning enemy, you gotta get creative.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665105"
            ]
          },
          "716665105": {
            "id": "716665105",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "When your tactics fail, you have to change your point of view. In our journeys far and wide, we often have to think on our feet!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665106"
            ]
          },
          "716665106": {
            "id": "716665106",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Clinging to old methods can never solve the problem, no matter how hard you try!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665107"
            ]
          },
          "716665107": {
            "id": "716665107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arataki Itto",
            "text": "I think Shinobu said something like that once, too. I guess there's something to it after all...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716665108"
            ]
          },
          "716665108": {
            "id": "716665108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arataki Itto",
            "text": "But I'll mull it over some other time. Right now, my focus is on the task at hand — more beetle-fighting!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}